<title>BELGIUM: Belgian franc steady in ERM grid.</title>
<headline>Belgian franc steady in ERM grid.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian franc was steady against the mark following the end of the Amsterdam summit.</p>
<p>Around 0630 GMT, the franc was at 20.6340/50 to the mark compared with late Tuesday levels around 20.6330/35.</p>
<p>The franc has been trading below its 20.6255 ERM midpoint to the mark for most of the year, having slid from its usual levels above the midpoint on domestic political turbulence.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
